name: Timelapse
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/timelapse/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Records a timelapse of your editing session — the full editor or just the current page — by capturing periodic snapshots, then exports a speed-adjustable video. Includes recording controls, an on-screen ● REC badge, and playback speed presets from 0.5× to 16×.
p/html: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/timelapse/timelapse.html
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/timelapse/timelapse.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/timelapse/timelapse.js
